 "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 1}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "type": "RSLT", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}, {"text": "<p><span class=\"strong\">Animal Entertainment \u2013 Offstage</span></p>Can you tell me how animals in entertainment really feel?  We often see them dancing in circuses, acting in movies, racing, or just playing around for our pleasure in zoos. I know you must feel depressed hearing that when they are out of the public eye, these animal performers often face a life full of misery and pain.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": ""}, {"text": "In circuses, when animals aren't on stage, they are most often kept in cages that are too small. In addition, their trainers remove their claws and put muzzles on their mouths. The animals are kept in chains and given tranquilizing drugs so that they won't hurt the people they work with. It must be traumatizing for them.", "id": 2, "time": "23000", "image": ""}, {"text": "In some countries where bullfights are popular, people get excited when the bulls die a painful death. In other countries, dogs are trained to tear each other apart, and sharp metal points are put on roosters to kill each other in what people call \"cockfights.\" You must be shocked to learn that animal fighting events have actually become more popular in recent years. Do you know what we can do about this? Is there anything that can be done?", "id": 3, "time": "43000", "image": ""}], "video_src": "engenn7le12ob01re2vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "_data": [], "type": "video", "template_override": 1}]}]}